UD TO ANNOUNCE A NEW COLLABORATION WITH NMAAHC AND THE CREATION OF THE FIRST-EVER CATERPILLAR CURATOR OF AFRICAN AMERICAN INNOVATION AND ENTREPRENEURSHIP THROUGH A $2 MILLION GRANT. THE GRANT WILL SUPPORT THE CREATION OF A NEW NMAAHC MUSEUM POSITION NAMED THE CATERPILLAR CURATOR OF AFRICAN AMERICAN INNOVATION AND ENTREPRENEURSHIP.'}{'symbol': 'CFG', 'date': '2021-11-05 16:46:00', 'title': 'CITIZENS FINANCIAL GROUP, INC. DECLARES DIVIDENDS ON PREFERRED STOCK', 'text': 'PROVIDENCE, R.I.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CITIZENS FINANCIAL GROUP, INC. DECLARES DIVIDENDS ON PREFERRED STOCK'}{'symbol': 'D', 'date': '2021-11-05 07:30:00', 'title': 'DOMINION ENERGY ANNOUNCES THIRD-QUARTER 2021 EARNINGS', 'text': 'RICHMOND, VA., NOV. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DOMINION ENERGY (NYSE: D) TODAY ANNOUNCED AN UNAUDITED NET INCOME DETERMINED IN ACCORDANCE WITH GENERALLY ACCEPTED ACCOUNTING PRINCIPLES (REPORTED EARNINGS) FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED SEPT.'}{'symbol': 'EBAY', 'date': '2021-11-05 09:00:00', 'title': 'EBAY\'S "THE SLEIGH DROP" BRINGS THE GIFT OF GRAILS TO HOLIDAY SHOPPERS', 'text': 'SAN JOSE, CALIF., NOV. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TODAY, EBAY \xa0ANNOUNCES "THE SLEIGH DROP," A NEW SNEAKER SALES EVENT THAT OFFERS EXCLUSIVE ACCESS TO SOME OF THE WORLD\'S COOLEST COLLECTIONS.'}{'symbol': 'EW', 'date': '2021-11-05 11:20:00', 'title': 'TAVR WITH SAPIEN 3 DEMONSTRATED AS ECONOMICALLY DOMINANT TREATMENT STRATEGY COMPARED TO SURGERY IN PARTNER 3 ANALYSIS', 'text': 'IRVINE, CALIF., NOV. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EDWARDS LIFESCIENCES (NYSE: EW) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT A COST-EFFECTIVENESS ANALYSIS COMPARING TRANSCATHETER AORTIC VALVE REPLACEMENT (TAVR) TO SURGERY DEMONSTRATED THAT TAVR WITH SAPIEN 3 IS AN ECONOMICALLY DOMINANT TREATMENT STRATEGY, OFFERING IMPROVED OUTCOMES AND REDUCED COST.'}{'symbol': 'FTV', 'date': '2021-11-05 11:00:00', 'title': 'FORTIVE APPOINTS ELENA ROSMAN AS VICE PRESIDENT OF INVESTOR RELATIONS', 'text': "EVERETT, WASH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FORTIVE CORPORATION (“FORTIVE”) (N