RED BY ICE IN LONDON AND WILL PHYSICALLY DELIVER CREDITS CERTIFIED UNDER VERRA'S VERIFIED CARBON STANDARD (VC"}{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2021-11-05 06:55:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON CONTROLS REPORTS SOLID FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR RESULTS; INITIATES FY22 GUIDANCE', 'text': 'CORK, IRELAND, NOV. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JOHNSON CONTROLS INTERNATIONAL PLC (NYSE: JCI), THE GLOBAL LEADER FOR SMART, HEALTHY AND SUSTAINABLE BUILDINGS, TODAY REPORTED FISCAL FOURTH QUARTER 2021 GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE ("EPS") FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS, INCLUDING SPECIAL ITEMS, OF $0.38. EXCLUDING THESE ITEMS, ADJUSTED EPS FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS WAS $0.88, UP 16% VERSUS THE PRIOR YEAR PERIOD (SEE ATTACHED FOOTNOTES FOR NON-GAAP RECONCILIATION).'}{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2021-11-05 03:05:00', 'title': "JOHNSON CONTROLS OPENBLUE TECHNOLOGIES TO POWER DERWENT LONDON'S DRIVE TOWARDS INTELLIGENT, HEALTHY AND SUSTAINABLE BUILDINGS", 'text': "CORK, IRELAND, NOV. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JOHNSON CONTROLS (NYSE: JCI), THE GLOBAL LEADER FOR SMART, HEALTHY AND SUSTAINABLE BUILDINGS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS OPENBLUE DIGITAL PLATFORM TECHNOLOGIES WILL BE ROLLED OUT ACROSS DERWENT LONDON'S PORTFOLIO. THIS ROLLOUT WILL DRIVE THE DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION OF DERWENT LONDON'S ESTATE, ENABLING NEW POSSIBILITIES FOR OPERATIONAL EFFICIENCY, OCCUPANT EXPERIENCES AND SUSTAINABILITY IN ONE DYNAMIC SOLUTION."}{'symbol': 'KSU', 'date': '2021-11-05 16:30:00', 'title': 'KANSAS CITY SOUTHERN DECLARES DIVIDENDS ON 4% NON-CUMULATIVE PREFERRED STOCK AND COMMON STOCK', 'text': "KANSAS CITY, MO.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--KANSAS CITY SOUTHERN'S (KCS) (NYSE:KSU) BOARD OF DIRECTORS ON NOVEMBER 5, 2021 DECLARED A REGULAR DIVIDEND OF $0.25 PER SHARE ON THE OUTSTANDING KCS 4% NON-CUMULATIVE PREFERRED STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JANUARY 18, 2022 TO PREFERRED STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 31, 2021. THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS ALSO DECLARED A REGULAR DIVIDEND OF $0.54 PER SHARE ON THE OUTSTANDING KCS COMMON STOCK. THIS DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JANUARY 19, 2"}{'symbol': 'K', 'date': '2021-11-05 11:22:00', 'title': 'TOLERI$K AND FINMASON ANNOUNCE INNOVATIVE PARTNERSHIP', 'text': "MARLTON, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TOLERI$K, A PROVIDER OF FIDUCIARY-CALIBER RISK TOLERANCE ASSESSMENT TECHNOLOGY FOR INVESTMENT ADVISORS, ANNOUNCES AN INNOVATIVE PARTNERSHIP ENTAILING THE SEAMLESS INTEGRATION OF ITS SOFTWARE WITH FINMASON'S PROPRIETARY ANALYTICS ENGINE. THE PRIMARY DIFFERENCE BETWEEN TOLERI$K AND OTHER RISK TOLERANCE TOOLS IS THAT IT DOESN'T JUST PROVIDE A PERSONALITY PROFILE, BUT RATHER ASSESSES EACH CLIENT'S MATHEMATICAL ABILITY TO TAKE RISK, WHILE OFFERING ACCOMPANYING ANALYTI"}{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2021-11-05 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES TO SHOWCASE SOLUTIONS AND EXPERTISE IN ELECTRONIC DESIGN AND MANUFACTURING TESTING AT PRODUCTRONICA 2021', 'text': 'SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #AUTOMATION--KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES TO SHOWCASE SOLUTIONS AND EXPERTISE IN ELECTRONIC DESIGN AND MANUFACTURING TESTING AT PRODUCTRONICA 2021'}{'symbol': 'KIM', 'date': '2021-11-05 06:50:00', 'title': 'KIMCO REALTY ANNOUNCES THIRD QUARTER 2021 RESULTS', 'text': "JERICHO, N.Y.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--KIMCO REALTY CORP. (NYSE: KIM), NORTH AMERICA'S LARGEST PUBLICLY TRADED OWNER AND OPERATOR OF OPEN-AIR, GROCERY-ANCHORED SHOPPING CENTERS AND MIXED-USE ASSETS, TODAY REPORTED RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2021. FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2021 AND 2020, KIMCO'S NET INCOME/(LOSS) AVAILABLE TO THE COMPANY'S COMMON SHAREHOLDERS WAS $0.91 PER DILUTED SHARE AND ($0.10) PER DILUTED SHARE, RESPECTIVELY. THIRD QUARTER HIGHLIGHTS: COMPLETE"}{'symbol': 'KLAC', 'date': '2021-11-05 12:20:00', 'title': 'KLA ANNOUNCES GRAND OPENING OF $200 MILLION SECOND HEADQUARTERS IN ANN ARBOR, MICHIGAN', 'text': 'MILPITAS, CALIF., NOV. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KLA CORPORATION\xa0(NASDAQ:\xa0KLAC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE OFFICIAL OPENING OF ITS SECOND U.S. HEADQUARTERS, A $2