PORTSBOOK AT VEE QUIVA', 'text': 'CHANDLER, ARIZ., NOV. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BETMGM, A LEADING SPORTS BETTING AND IGAMING OPERATOR, AND GILA RIVER HOTELS & CASINOS TODAY ANNOUNCED THE OPENING OF THE BETMGM SPORTSBOOK AT VEE QUIVA.'}{'symbol': 'MOS', 'date': '2021-11-05 09:22:00', 'title': 'MOSAIC ANNOUNCES PRICING OF SECONDARY OFFERING AND CONCURRENT SHARE REPURCHASE', 'text': 'TAMPA, FL / ACCESSWIRE / NOVEMBER 5, 2021 / THE MOSAIC COMPANY (NYSE:MOS) ("MOSAIC") TODAY ANNOUNCED THE PRICING OF THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED UNDERWRITTEN SECONDARY OFFERING BY VALE S.A. AND ITS AFFILIATE (TOGETHER, THE "SELLING STOCKHOLDER") OF 34,176,574 SHARES OF COMMON STOCK OF MOSAIC PURSUANT TO A REGISTRATION STATEMENT FILED BY MOSAIC WITH THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION (THE "SEC").'}{'symbol': 'NEE', 'date': '2021-11-05 16:30:00', 'title': 'NEXTERA ENERGY AND NEXTERA ENERGY PARTNERS TO PARTICIPATE IN EEI FINANCIAL CONFERENCE AND MEET WITH INVESTORS THROUGHOUT NOVEMBER AND DECEMBER', 'text': 'JUNO BEACH, FLA., NOV. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NEXTERA ENERGY, INC. (NYSE: NEE) AND NEXTERA ENERGY PARTNERS, LP (NYSE: NEP) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MEMBERS OF THE SENIOR MANAGEMENT TEAM WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE\xa0EEI FINANCIAL CONFERENCE\xa0FROM\xa0SUNDAY, NOV. 7, 2021, THROUGH\xa0TUESDAY, NOV. 9, 2021, AND PARTICIPATE IN VARIOUS INVESTOR MEETINGS THROUGHOUT NOVEMBER AND DECEMBER.'}{'symbol': 'PBCT', 'date': '2021-11-05 16:01:00', 'title': "PEOPLE'S UNITED FINANCIAL, INC. ANNOUNCES ANNUAL SHAREHOLDERS MEETING DATE", 'text': 'BRIDGEPORT, CONN., NOV.\xa05, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PEOPLE\'S UNITED FINANCIAL, INC. (THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: PBCT), THE HOLDING COMPANY FOR PEOPLE\'S UNITED BANK, N.A.'}{'symbol': 'PNW', 'date': '2021-11-05 08:40:00', 'title': 'PINNACLE WEST REPORTS 2021 THIRD-QUARTER RESULTS, SHARES LONG-TERM FINANCIAL OUTLOOK', 'text': 'PHOENIX--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PINNACLE WEST CAPITAL REPORTS LOWER THIRD-QUARTER RESULTS, WHICH WERE IMPACTED BY MILDER WEATHER, AND SHARES LONG-TERM FINANCIAL OUTLOOK.'}{'symbol': 'PEG', 'date': '2021-11-05 08:00:00', 'title': 'PSEG CEO RALPH IZZO ATTENDS COP26, CALLS FOR URGENT ACTION ON CLIMATE', 'text': 'NEWARK, N.J., NOV. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PSEG CHAIRMAN, PRESIDENT AND CEO RALPH IZZO IS TRAVELING TO GLASGOW, SCOTLAND, TO ATTEND THE 26TH CONFERENCE OF THE PARTIES TO THE UNITED NATIONS FRAMEWORK CONVENTION ON CLIMATE CHANGE (COP26), WHERE HE WILL CALL FOR URGENT ACTION TO ADDRESS CLIMATE CHANGE.'}{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2021-11-05 07:05:00', 'title': 'ONCOR REPORTS THIRD QUARTER 2021 RESULTS', 'text': 'DALLAS, NOV. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ONCOR ELECTRIC DELIVERY COMPANY LLC ("ONCOR") TODAY REPORTED THREE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2021 NET INCOME OF $258 MILLION COMPARED TO NET INCOME OF $258 MILLION IN THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2020. NET INCOME FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2021, INCLUDED A NET INCREASE IN REVENUES CONTRIBUTING TO EARNINGS PRIMARILY FROM UPDATES TO BASE TRANSMISSION AND DISTRIBUTION RATES TO REFLECT INCREASES IN INVESTED CAPITAL AND CUSTOMER GROWTH, OFFSET BY INCREASES IN OPERATION AND MAINTENANCE EXPENSE AND COSTS ASSOCIATED WITH ADDITIONAL INVESTMENT (PRIMARILY DEPRECIATION AND AMORTIZATION AND PROPERTY TAXES) AND LOWER OTHER MISCELLANEOUS REVENUES DURING THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2021 DUE TO THE RECOGNITION OF AN ANNUAL ENERGY EFFICIENCY PROGRAM PERFORMANCE BONUS THAT WAS APPROVED IN THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2020, BUT PENDING PUBLIC UTILITY COMMISSION OF TEXAS ("PUCT") APPROVAL IN 2021.'}{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2021-11-05 06:55:00', 'title': 'SEMPRA REPORTS THIRD-QUARTER 2021 EARNINGS RESULTS', 'text': "SAN DIEGO, NOV. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SEMPRA (NYSE: SRE) (BMV: SRE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THIRD-QUARTER 2021 LOSSES OF $648 MILLION, OR $2.03 PER DILUTED SHARE, COMPARED TO THIRD-QUARTER 2020 EARNINGS OF $351 MILLION, OR $1.21 PER DILUTED SHARE. SEMPRA'S THIRD-QUARTER 2021 RESULTS INCLUDED A $1.1 BILLION AFTER-TAX CHARGE ASSOCIATED WITH CIVIL LITIGATION RELATED TO THE 2015 ALISO CANYON NATURAL GAS STORAGE FACILITY LEAK."}{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2021-11-05 11:01:00', 'title': 'SOUTHERN COMPANY PARTICIPATES IN THE 26TH UN CLIMATE CHANGE CONFERENCE OF THE PARTIES (COP26) IN GLASGOW', 'text': 'ATLANTA, NOV. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHERN COMPANY EXECUTIVES ARE PARTICIPATING IN THE 26TH UN CLIMATE CHANGE CONFERENCE OF THE PARTIES IN GLASGOW, SCOTLAND. SOUTHERN COMPANY WAS ONE OF THE FIRST COMPANIES IN ITS INDUSTRY TO SET A LONG-TERM GOAL OF ACHIEVING NET-ZERO GREENHOUSE GAS (GHG) EMISSIONS BY 2050, AS WELL AS AN INTERIM GOAL OF REDUCING GHG EMISSIONS 50% BY 2030, AS COMPARED TO 2007 LEVELS.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2021-11-05 14:05:00', 'title': 'DENVER MAYOR DECLARES "SOUTHWEST AIRLINES DAY" TO CELEBRATE 15 YEARS OF SOUTHWEST SERVICE IN THE MILE HIGH CITY', 'text': 'DALLAS, NOV. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. \xa0(NYSE: LUV) TODAY JOINS IN CELEBRATING A MILESTONE OF SERVING DENVER AS MAYOR MICHAEL B. HANCOCK OFFICIALLY DECLARES NOV. 5, 2021, AS "SOUTHWEST AIRLINES DAY" IN THE CITY.'}{'symbol': 'VTR', 'date': '2021-11-05 06:55:00', 'title': 'VENTAS REPORTS 2021 THIRD QUARTER RESULTS', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VENTAS, INC. (NYSE: VTR) (“VENTAS” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY REPORTED RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2021. “VENTAS'S HIGH-QUALITY DIVERSIFIED PORTFOLIO DEMONSTRATED STRENGTH IN THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2021 DESPITE THE CHALLENGES OF COVID-19 AND A TIGHT LABOR MARKET. WE ARE PLEASED WITH THE GROWTH IN OUR LIFE SCIENCE, MEDICAL OFFICE AND HEALTHCARE TRIPLE NET PORTFOLIOS. WE ARE ALSO SEEING SUSTAINED DEMAND AND REVENUE GROWTH IN OUR SENIOR HOUSING COMMUNITIE"}{'symbol': 'VIAC', 'date': '2021-11-05 19:33:00', 'title': 'VIACOMCBS SHAREHOLDER ALERT', 'text': 'SECURITIES LITIGATION PARTNER JAMES (JOSH) WILSON ENCOURAGES INVESTORS WHO SUFFERED LOSSES EXCEEDING $50,000 IN VIACOMCBS TO CONTACT HIM DIRECTLY TO DISCUSS THEIR OPTIONSNEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - NOVEMBER 5, 2021) - FARUQI & FARU